IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TABLE-SUM.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 NUMS.
   05 N PIC 99 OCCURS 5 TIMES VALUES 1 2 3 4 5.
01 I PIC 9.
01 TOTAL PIC 999 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
        ADD N(I) TO TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY TOTAL
    STOP RUN.
